Test GnuPG home for signed-gpkg oracles (plan #326 S4).

Copied verbatim from portuale 3rdparty/portage/lib/portage/tests/.gnupg
(Portage 3.0.82.2), the keyring real Portage's own gpkg signing tests use.
Two keys, both with passphrase "GentooTest":
- 0x5D90EA06352177F6, trusted: portuale's signed-output acceptance test
  signs with it;
- 0x8812797DDF1DD192, of undefined trust: the gpkg/signed oracle signs
  with it (the field dump does not depend on the key), and verify refuses
  it ("known key of undefined trust").
portuale's binpkg.rs verify tests sign with both; emerge_getbinpkg.rs
verifies a committed signed fixture against this keyring.
Test-only: never trust either key.
